    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOB CRATCHIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bob Cratchit is Scrooge's clerk, who celebrates Christmas Eve despite Scrooge's reluctance to give time off, showing a more cheerful and optimistic attitude."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bob Cratchit is the clerk to Ebenezer Scrooge and father to the Cratchit family, known for his kindness and dedication."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9aac3484185ac66045df92214d245d5</data>
