    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHRISTMAS EVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christmas Eve is a significant event in the narrative, representing a time of celebration that contrasts with Scrooge's miserly nature."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas Eve is the day when this scene takes place, emphasizing the contrast between Scrooge's bleak outlook and the festive atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d9aac3484185ac66045df92214d245d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0</data>
