      <data key="d1">"The Court is an area outside Scrooge's counting-house where people pass by in the fog, indicative of the dreary and oppressive atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nature is depicted as harsh and cold, with the fog and weather contributing to the oppressive atmosphere in the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLERK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Clerk in Scrooge's counting-house is depicted as expectant and possibly weary, symbolizing the impact of Scrooge's attitudes on others."&lt;SEP&gt;"The clerk works for Scrooge, showing enthusiasm for Christmas despite having a modest income."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d5764e301321c087f5a8f78b73a145</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MR. MARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mr. Marley was Scrooge's former business partner, deceased for seven years, remembered for shared business values with Scrooge."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}]</data>
