    <node id="&quot;CHRISTMAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christmas is a time characterized by joy, generosity, and communal spirit, contrasting with Scrooge's negative view of it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christmas is the festive season during which the events unfold, characterized by themes of generosity and celebration."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d5764e301321c087f5a8f78b73a145</data>
