    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BEDLAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bedlam, historically known as a mental institution, is referenced by Scrooge as a place he would retire to due to his clerk's idealism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARLIAMENT&quot;">
