      <data key="d1">"The British Parliament is mentioned by Scrooge in a comment to his nephew, suggesting he should become a politician because of his eloquent speech."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCROOGE'S OFFICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Scrooge's office is a location where much of the dialogue in the text takes place, serving as the setting for interactions with his nephew and the portly gentlemen."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd</data>
    </node>
