    <node id="&quot;THE WINE-MERCHANT'S CELLAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Wine-Merchant's Cellar is part of Scrooge's house, from where eerie sounds are heard, contributing to the atmosphere of the haunted setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUTCH MERCHANT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Dutch Merchant is referenced as the original creator of the fireplace, which features Dutch tiles illustrating biblical scenes."</data>
