    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAINS AND ABELS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cains and Abels are biblical stories depicted on the Dutch tiles, contributing to the rich and historical aesthetic of the fireplace."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHARAOH'S DAUGHTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pharaoh's Daughter is a biblical figure whose story is illustrated on the Dutch tiles in Scrooge's fireplace."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUEENS OF SHEBA&quot;">
