      <data key="d1">"Queens of Sheba are biblical figures depicted on the Dutch tiles that decorate Scrooge's fireplace."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANGELIC MESSENGERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Angelic Messengers are part of the biblical scenes on the Dutch tiles in Scrooge's fireplace, depicting messengers descending on clouds."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JACOB MARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jacob Marley is the deceased former business partner of Scrooge, known for his miserly ways in life. His ghost visits Scrooge to warn him about the consequences of his actions and to attempt to save him from a similar fate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jacob Marley, in his lifetime, was Scrooge's business partner, whose spirit now roams with the burden of a chain he created due to his greed and narrow-mindedness."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARLEY'S CHAIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marley's Chain is a symbolic representation of his past life's burdens and misdeeds. It is described as being made of cash-boxes, keys, padlocks, ledgers, deeds, and heavy purses, and serves as a warning to Scrooge of the consequences of a life led without compassion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE GHOST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Ghost refers to Marley's spectral form, visiting Scrooge to deliver a warning about his lifestyle. It is an apparition that embodies Marley's unresolved issues and the message he must convey to Scrooge."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE STAR THAT LED THE WISE MEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This event refers to the guiding star of the biblical Magi, used by the Ghost as a metaphor for enlightenment and guiding others to a virtuous life."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAN OF THE WORLDLY MIND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This is a reference to someone who is skeptical or focused solely on practical or material concerns, as initially attributed to Scrooge by the Ghost."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE PHANTOM/SPIRIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Phantom or Spirit is another name for the Ghost of Jacob Marley, emphasizing its ethereal and haunting nature."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FELLOW-MEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fellow-men refers to humanity in general, the people Scrooge and Marley could have positively impacted during their lives."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
    </node>
