      <data key="d1">"Immortal Creatures is a description used symbolically to possibly refer to spirits or entities working for the betterment of the earth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLESSED STAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Blessed Star is another term for the guiding star that led the Wise Men, symbolizing enlightenment and guiding others to goodness."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-359187e7571bda4b0b08b2e0b6581e52</data>
    </node>
