      <data key="d1">"Penance refers to Jacob Marley's ongoing punishment for his earthly deeds, which he contrasts with Scrooge's opportunity for redemption."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44d647b83223cc8b53863d27ac7cc4bf</data>
    </node>
