    <edge source="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;" target="&quot;MARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Marley was Scrooge's deceased business partner whose face appears on the door knocker, creating a supernatural experience for Scrooge.&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge and Marley were business partners in life, and Marley's ghost appears to Scrooge trying to persuade him of the reality of the supernatural and to impart a message."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge and Marley were long-time business partners and close acquaintances, with Scrooge being his sole executor and mourner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge is haunted by the memory of Marley and is directly confronted by Marley's Ghost."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9aac3484185ac66045df92214d245d5</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE AND MARLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Scrooge maintained the firm name 'Scrooge and Marley' after Marley's death, signifying the continuity of their business presence."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;" target="&quot;MARLEY'S GHOST&quot;">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Scrooge is confronted by the apparition of Marley's Ghost, causing him disbelief and fear."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge is confronted with Marley's Ghost as part of the supernatural events that challenge his skepticism and prompt his eventual realization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The appearance of Marley's Ghost is a crucial event for Scrooge, influencing the transformation he undergoes in the story."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SCROOGE&quot;" target="&quot;SCROOGE'S NEPHEW&quot;">
      <data key="d4">14.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Scrooge's Nephew approaches Scrooge with a cheerful disposition, trying to spread Christmas cheer, but is met with Scrooge's disdain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Scrooge's nephew attempts to maintain a positive relationship and invites Scrooge to dine, despite Scrooge's dismissive attitude."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dac41b3f9eeaf794f0147400b1718cd</data>
